processing the application through a machine learning component, wherein the machine learning component uses demographic, financial, and other relevant data to generate a score indicating the likelihood that the applicant is entitled to the requested certificate, permit, or clearance;
issuing a verifiable credential to the applicant indicating the entitlement to the Community Tax Certificate or other relevant permit or clearance, wherein issuance is done via a digital wallet;
creating a transaction in the form of a non-fungible token (NFT) stored on a blockchain, wherein the NFT corresponds to the verifiable credential and includes an identifier and a description of the entitlement to the Community Tax Certificate or other relevant permit or clearance;
